e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zABEzi--ZsMQ7kNvwGUx8tT&_nc_oc=AdoXs0US3T0OupAjfky1Tdp0_Gd97c902PkF7ZcRaZy-D87zrkZjWsjtEzL9cCxSCuk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7XM4-xt_RiTpB9-XwkbhLUkpHRgJG_8Tr6lSze-UI7Cw&oe=6A0736F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PQ-LR37254kQ7kNvwFBNAqn&_nc_oc=AdpqpTMR55-yWtDq8CHwuIJ774wjQRgRQmq_8WbPbv6hsgeZap2fhhzJMVQkttFrcdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5OXdVmd1BJdbDUhoflwZpc_bXgngQ-VFkFLKVRnpTT_Q&oe=6A070E53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bHmkHixgmFUQ7kNvwFX8bzw&_nc_oc=Adp9V7AVXID6m6d51xtnlTX2ZKfm-6MXjG8-yqR_DnzOX6OtqH8oBfLgPIMFzA0kK6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5h_tWWtcgYh-tluzT40eIeVR8u8pSyoTlzS90a-uodkw&oe=6A0719FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLcLNvhJCS8Q7kNvwEaAnEu&_nc_oc=Adrtsw09AEtNRb3q7KqzlQQQhEuqyKQXlDmL956nRQf2EdSLMapo4r9L3P3kgmhq_l0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Iq-elwqmeG_v6sON98a3yqZ1hQIC6uHawwBCQrgMMuQ&oe=6A071B4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0joaG-f-Q_gQ7kNvwH6tkPH&_nc_oc=AdoQrro-6WfSzUBPowW3r6VdSNRrAbLBCrN5X8FjDCMdNWEJx_iTj9TiC_iVyeZW8Qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af76q18K3O-oePoZMOts37gK67YEsk0yolp_DbHXzgl86g&oe=6A073CBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se